{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play the role of a brave contestant who receives a mysterious invitation and joins this game of survival or death. The rules, derived from childhood games, conceal dangers. Each game appears simple but requires strategy and skill to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure that will get your heart racing. Every victory will bring you rich rewards, and every failure is an opportunity to grow. Come and join the game, start your own adventure, and become the ultimate winner!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlimited Levels, Unique Experiences</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels may end, but they will never stop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic levels loop continuously, with difficulty levels constantly increasing. No need to worry about getting bored, as there will always be new content waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/extras/d9d02a379207bcad147c56f3d8b832ac.poster.avif?t=1758249865\" width=700 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/extras/d9d02a379207bcad147c56f3d8b832ac.webm?t=1758249865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/extras/d9d02a379207bcad147c56f3d8b832ac.mp4?t=1758249865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solo Play Without Team-Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a \u201cmultiplayer game\u201d that can be enjoyed solo. No need to worry about the difficulty of finding a team. In single-player mode, you can play all levels by yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/extras/d8ca77ec029a6782febe3c88346aa2ad.poster.avif?t=1758249865\" width=700 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/extras/d8ca77ec029a6782febe3c88346aa2ad.webm?t=1758249865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/extras/d8ca77ec029a6782febe3c88346aa2ad.mp4?t=1758249865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feel the Celebration at the End of Successful Level Completion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a combination of brainpower and manual dexterity. After overcoming numerous obstacles, you will be greeted with a victory celebration at the finish line!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/extras/2ad194e26bbec61e363aef9d8020af9b.poster.avif?t=1758249865\" width=700 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/extras/2ad194e26bbec61e363aef9d8020af9b.webm?t=1758249865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/extras/2ad194e26bbec61e363aef9d8020af9b.mp4?t=1758249865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person perspective, providing a more immersive gaming experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D cartoon style, offering a more visually pleasing gaming experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic levels, rotating for continuous play. As long as you keep playing, the adventure never ends.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Maze Challenge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564790/dbd910c53bc29987c83bc3da5bed0e37024341fe.jpg"},{"name":"Boxing match","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564790/c76b7764941108ea21d378f40994f863a02221f5.jpg"},{"name":"Deadly tug-of-war competition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564790/3f35957644df0f717d00912781af4f1eebf86b32.jpg"},{"name":"Marble game competition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564790/62bb1dcb79fe46340f6954ef281fb5a054bf0fc7.jpg"},{"name":"Glass bridge challenge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564790/536e50903095b78a301c475db7f04640ad784b02.jpg"},{"name":"Honeycomb sugar challenge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564790/e6aa408579fd8c271fc54dd5af118ba381735753.jpg"},{"name":"Food Race Challenge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564790/ee4b17191d5fe64cc27ca385da4e8077016baa61.jpg"},{"name":"5 levels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564790/2bc449de7a24b635790849592b9026fe0be5e908.jpg"},{"name":"10 levels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564790/be06ce6622e257bccb53cf44c2b1a948ec596077.jpg"},{"name":"30 levels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564790/fd3bec4d62f2b29f54a53881c35f3eece8b37b8e.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564790?t=1758249865","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564790?t=1758249865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/de30e8dc69fb3b7989af5a2c17dc09abf28e4fe1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758249865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/de30e8dc69fb3b7989af5a2c17dc09abf28e4fe1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758249865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Follow Us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play the role of a brave contestant who receives a mysterious invitation and joins this game of survival or death. The rules, derived from childhood games, conceal dangers. Each game appears simple but requires strategy and skill to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure that will get your heart racing. Every victory will bring you rich rewards, and every failure is an opportunity to grow. Come and join the game, start your own adventure, and become the ultimate winner!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlimited Levels, Unique Experiences</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels may end, but they will never stop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic levels loop continuously, with difficulty levels constantly increasing. No need to worry about getting bored, as there will always be new content waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/extras/d9d02a379207bcad147c56f3d8b832ac.poster.avif?t=1758249865\" width=700 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/extras/d9d02a379207bcad147c56f3d8b832ac.webm?t=1758249865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/extras/d9d02a379207bcad147c56f3d8b832ac.mp4?t=1758249865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solo Play Without Team-Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a \u201cmultiplayer game\u201d that can be enjoyed solo. No need to worry about the difficulty of finding a team. In single-player mode, you can play all levels by yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/extras/d8ca77ec029a6782febe3c88346aa2ad.poster.avif?t=1758249865\" width=700 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/extras/d8ca77ec029a6782febe3c88346aa2ad.webm?t=1758249865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/extras/d8ca77ec029a6782febe3c88346aa2ad.mp4?t=1758249865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feel the Celebration at the End of Successful Level Completion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a combination of brainpower and manual dexterity. After overcoming numerous obstacles, you will be greeted with a victory celebration at the finish line!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/extras/2ad194e26bbec61e363aef9d8020af9b.poster.avif?t=1758249865\" width=700 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/extras/2ad194e26bbec61e363aef9d8020af9b.webm?t=1758249865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/extras/2ad194e26bbec61e363aef9d8020af9b.mp4?t=1758249865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person perspective, providing a more immersive gaming experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D cartoon style, offering a more visually pleasing gaming experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic levels, rotating for continuous play. As long as you keep playing, the adventure never ends.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Shine Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564790/420b8db2aeba044f50c88897efb3fef6afcb39d3/header.jpg?t=1758249865","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3564790/2108239610/4ad685de5c604ee685becf6ed99fa417fa70848e/1755761369/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755762823","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3564790/2108239610/4ad685de5c604ee685becf6ed99fa417fa70848e/1755761369/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755762823","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3564790/2108239610/4ad685de5c604ee685becf6ed99fa417fa70848e/1755761369/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755762823","id":257165179,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257165179/movie480.mp4?t=1755762823","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257165179/movie_max.mp4?t=1755762823"},"name":"Courage Gauntlet Challenge PV EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257165179/7327f0e5d65c76caa979e8b306d18cd241c89684/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755762823","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257165179/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755762823","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257165179/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755762823"}}],"name":"Courage Gauntlet Chal